291
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:55,300
So how often have you heard someone saying, well,

292
00:11:55,300 --> 00:11:57,200
there's a special interest that's blocking reform.

293
00:11:57,940 --> 00:11:59,300
Special interests are blocking reform.

294
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:01,820
The teachers unions are blocking merit pay.

295
00:12:02,860 --> 00:12:05,300
Right now, on the surface this is a pretty strange thing

296
00:12:05,300 --> 00:12:08,520
to say because are the teachers, do they have guns?

297
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,260
Do they have tanks?

298
00:12:09,260 --> 00:12:11,060
What do the teachers have that could block anything?

299
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:13,920
Yes. Well, they do.

300
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,920
In the United States?

301
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:19,260
So once or twice I've seen a picket line I was scared

302
00:12:19,260 --> 00:12:20,900
to cross, but when the high school teachers

