305
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,000
It wasn't like that.

306
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:31,960
Okay. So what does it mean then that they're blocking reform?

307
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:35,040
Well, something like teachers normally just means the teacher

308
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:37,500
