309
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:40,380
And this actually seems to matter.

310
00:12:40,880 --> 00:12:43,780
It actually seems to matter that teachers are popular.

311
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:45,060
And if teachers don't like something,

312
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,620
a lot of voters don't like it either.

313
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:49,760
Now, but anyway, even if you buy this story,

